Building the GdbARiscV64Plugin
------------------------------

In the build dirctory for the platform (e.g. building/linux64x64
for 64-bit linux) locate the gdbriscv64 directory.

In that directory use the makeem script, which invokes conf.COG, to
configure and build the gdb-derived simulator for RiscV64 RV64g.
Then build a VM that has GdbRiscV64Plugin in its plugins.ext.

Note README, instructions to build gdb-18.1 in
  processors/RiscV64
